      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Newton_Falls%2C_New_York",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Before the mill, a massive iron strip mine called Benson Mines operated at the junction of CR 60 and NY 3, employing 1,200 workers at its peak.",
